      "id": "claim_d28d41f8eaf243b1b5afcc0208d4a487",
      "statement": "The Baseline_Projection sheet rolls CET1 capital forward over nine quarters (Q3 2026 to Q3 2028) from Q2 2026 actuals using CET1(t) = CET1(t-1) + net income − preferred dividends − common dividends − share repurchases + other CET1 movements, with RWA growing at a constant quarterly rate and the CET1 ratio computed as ending CET1 / RWA.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/models/capital-planning-model.md#L224-L262",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6bdb25b6f7e7cd74a4b48cea93c8af738038f14c758c925efa48d73b6058b95c:"
